ding  to her and her webb's design because how  good is a vulture in a cage having no  memory of his captor free the bird and  give the fatherless peter a papa i mean  i don't know i feel like dakota johnson  can say something cooler than that  that's just that's just my pitch i mean  sony could just claim this as a win and  say this universe was always andrew  garfield's universe and now this  universe is centered around the peter  parker with the best character arc and  one of the biggest films of all time a  broken peter who began his story bitter  and rageville but ends with his  amazingness affirmed andrew garfield  worked so well in no way home because  the story embraced the mistakes his era  of the character was most criticized for  and sony can now do the same thing with  tombs and morbius and since espinosa is  betting our lives that sony plans to  bring into the spider-verse miles  morales into live-action and it was  andrew in lecture who speculated about  the black spider-man in that scene i  think we all agree that this peter works  best as an older brother and could be an  amazing mentor to miles morales ah this  is so cool  i always wanted brothers let me know  your thoughts on all this in the  comments below follow me on instagram  and twitter at eight boss following  rockstar subscribe to interaction for  more analysis of everything you love  thanks for watching bye  [Music]  you

